msgctxt "#33116"
msgid "Compress artwork (reduces quality)"
msgstr "アートワークを圧縮 (画質が低下します)"

msgctxt "#33118"
msgid "You've changed the playback mode. Kodi needs to be reset to apply the change, would you like to do this now?"
msgstr ""
"再生モードを変更しました。変更を反映するには Kodi の再起動が必要です。います"
"ぐ再起動しますか？"

msgctxt "#33119"
msgid "Something went wrong during the sync. You'll be able to restore progress when restarting Kodi. If the problem persists, please report on the Jellyfin for Kodi forums, with your Kodi log."
msgstr ""
"同期で問題が発生しました。Kodi の再起動に復元できます。問題が解決しない場合"
"は Jellyfin for Kodi フォーラムに Kodi のログを添付して報告してください。"

msgctxt "#33120"
msgid "Select the libraries to add"
msgstr "追加するライブラリーを選択"

msgctxt "#33121"
